# Build contexts at the repository root: the runners, the facade, and the production image.
# Everything else stays out, including .env and .env.* (secrets) and docs/ (the answer key).
**
!runners/**
!modern/**
!orchestrator/pyproject.toml
!orchestrator/uv.lock
!orchestrator/alembic.ini
!orchestrator/alembic/**
!orchestrator/app/**
!frontend/**
!legacy/billrite/src/**
!legacy/billrite/copy/**
!legacy/billrite/data/LAYOUTS.txt
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/.angular/
**/dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/.env
**/.env.*
